<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech Transfinance says CP issue fully subscribed.</title>
<headline>Czech Transfinance says CP issue fully subscribed.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Czech factoring company Transfinance a.s. on Thursday said its 145 million crown commercial paper issue had been fully subscribed.</p>
<p>Yield on the paper, which was issued at 968,138 crowns for a one million crown nominally valued bond, is 13.02 percent.</p>
</text>
